{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_rules_ponytail_ponytail_rule", "label": "Ponytail Rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/rules/ponytail.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lazy senior developer mode. Emphasizes efficiency over carelessness, writing minimum code, and verifying understanding before implementing."}, {"id": "_agents_rules_ponytail_decision_ladder", "label": "Ponytail Decision Ladder", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/rules/ponytail.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A sequence of questions to ask before writing code: YAGNI, reuse codebase patterns/utils, standard library, native platform, installed dependency, one-liner, and then minimum code."}, {"id": "_agents_rules_ponytail_bug_fixing_philosophy", "label": "Ponytail Bug Fixing Philosophy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/rules/ponytail.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bug fixes should target the root cause, not just symptoms. Grep all callers of a function and fix the shared function once rather than patching each path individually."}, {"id": "_agents_rules_ponytail_ponytail_comment", "label": "Ponytail Comments for Deliberate Simplification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/rules/ponytail.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Marking deliberate simplifications that cut corners with a comment naming the ceiling and upgrade path."}, {"id": "_agents_rules_ponytail_testing_philosophy", "label": "Ponytail Testing Philosophy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/rules/ponytail.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "ratio